      englishFallback: Power and clean-water service are returning across the east
        district. The families reached the school shelter without crossing the exposed
        lane, and there is room for everyone tonight.
      speaker: 1
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6688eb288a4d8430fb69174a8322b2b1, type: 3}
